        "rows": [
          [
            "security",
            "publet-core 0.1.4 replaces 0.1.2: it moves to ed25519-dalek 3 and sha2 0.11, so block-buffer 0.10.4 (GHSA-qwgh-2vcv-g2f7) is no longer built into pubrel; the new crates' cargo vet exemptions record the evidence that exists"
          ],
          [
            "added",
            "`prepare --all` cuts one release pull request for every package with unreleased changes, each after the packages it depends on, so the workspace pins and Cargo.lock record their released versions"
          ],
          [
            "fixed",
            "`tag` tries every package before failing, so one package that fails to tag does not keep the others in the same release from being tagged"
          ],
          [
            "added",
            "when the quality audit report is missing, `prepare` names `pubkit audit prepare --package NAME` as the next step"
          ]
        ]
      },
